,"user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/316","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/milestone/316","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/316/labels","id":10687661,"node_id":"MI_kwDOCFbutM4AoxSt","number":316,"title":"3.8.3","description":"","creator":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":46,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-03-15T08:52:39Z","updated_at":"2024-04-11T14:28:38Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2024-03-15T17:50:56Z"},"comments":18,"created_at":"2024-02-28T07:43:57Z","updated_at":"2024-03-17T18:25:27Z","closed_at":"2024-03-07T11:44:35Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Describe the bug\n\nWe use the reactive postgresql datasource, with configured max-size and enabled datasource health check.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe maximum number of open connections are equals the configured number.\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nThe number of open database connections increases to twice the maximum number configured.\n\n### How to Reproduce?\n\n1. Create a simple app with reactive postgresql datasource and datasource health check (quarkus create app  --extension='resteasy-reactive,reactive-pg-client,resteasy-reactive-jackson,smallrye-health')\r\n2. Configure max-size (quarkus.datasource.reactive.max-size=5)\r\n3. Enable health check (quarkus.datasource.health.enabled=false)\r\n4. Create an endpoint with database access\r\n5. Call this endpoint and the health endpoint a view times (for example with apache benchmark)\r\n6. Check the open connections in your database\r\n\r\nSmall reproducer can be found here: https://github.com/dgewiss/quarkus-reactive-health-check-test\n\n### Output of `uname -a` or `ver`\n\n_No response_\n\n### Output of `java -version`\n\nopenjdk 21 2023-09-19 LTS\n\n### Quarkus version or git rev\n\n3.7.4\n\n### Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`)\n\nApache Maven 3.9.6\n\n### Additional information\n\nThis workaround works for me:\r\n\r\nDisable the datasource health check and use a own implementation of ReactivePgDataSourcesHealthCheck.\r\n\r\nThe difference to the original implementation is that `io.vertx.mutiny.pgclient.PgPool` is used to select the connection pool instead of `io.vertx.pgclient.PgPool`. The delegate is then passed to the ReactiveDatasourceHealthCheck.\r\n\r\nThis workraound is also incuded in the reproducer.","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/39047/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/39047/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}